# Workshop gallery, "The day the giants came to the fence" (shotlist of 2026-11-10, recomposed after the rating of runs 9e30 and 105f; replaces the plan of
# 2026-10-26; PUBLICATION.md, "Screenshots" and "Gallery subtitles"). Every cell is unread: the run decides. Why recomposed: at 268 px the subject was about 15 px
# (root size 6), the barn floor was bare hay, a neighbour pen and a pool table showed, the butcher scene had an impossible state (carcass AND products), the
# hearth showed nothing the mod brings. Fixes: root size 3 to 4, one insect species (the Megaspider) from the gate to the table, a wider emptied area so no stray
# furniture shows, denser decor, Nelim in the same rust shirt all day.
#
# STORY. One day in Nelim's Sanctuary, the only colonist (NSB's Nelim; no other colonist, owner rule 2026-10-25). A Megaspider walked up to the bamboo gate
# overnight. Nelim meets it at dawn, the hunt is over by morning, the work is done by late morning, and the one thing the whole day shows is what the mod
# changes: an insect gives meat, fat and leather and no bone, while a mammal still gives its bone. Thread of the series: Shogun the Labrador (an animal of the
# fixture, placed by name) is frozen beside Nelim at the gate in 1, sniffs the carcass in 2, watches the products in 3, stands by the Muffalo bone in 4, lies by the
# fire in 5. Rhythm: one hour per image (6, 9, 11, 14, 19), the photographer's choice (GALLERY.md, 2026-10-14); same day, clear sky, lantern lit at dawn and dusk.
# Opening image 1 (the place and the giant), closing image 5 (the hearth). Shots: wide (1, root 4), medium (2, root 3.5), close (3, root 3), medium (4, root 3.5),
# close (5, root 3).
#
# NELIM, continuity. Dark ponytail, rust shirt, dark trousers all day (never a hat: no hat-hair mod needed). Scene 1 adds an olive duster (cold dawn); it is off
# from scene 2 on (it warmed up: the plan says so). Face: her own (two brows, smirk, blink); no mouth or lid step, they are not proven without the experimental
# facial mods. The first `wears` undresses her: trousers are put back every time. Her smile is the face kit's default; no sweat (temperature 20 degrees).
#
# SCENES (index, place, hour; subject; composition; living things; decor; what the picture says; subtitle). Estimate: 5, minus 0.5 per weak criterion.
#   1. workshop-1-dawn. enclosure-south, 06:00, Clear, +25 ticks. Nelim (olive duster over the rust shirt) walks toward the gate; a Megaspider stands at the gate
#         facing South, toward the camera (the one front-facing animal of the series), the gate fence just behind it; Shogun frozen at her side. Root size 4 centred
#         (159, 209): fence line along the top of the frame (gate at z 207), Megaspider centre-back, Nelim left third, low light. Decor, place kept as is (fence,
#         gates, crop zone stay): DR_StickLantern lit (157, 209) by the gate, a PlantPot (154, 211), a Plant_Daylily fully grown (162, 211), a Stool (153, 208)
#         (removed after). Says: the giant came in the night, and she walks up to it. Moment: just before she reaches the gate. Gesture: `"Nelim" is forced to walk to`
#         (154, 210) then a paused advance of 25 ticks (played). Estimate 4.5 (j weak: the creature, not yet the mod).
#   2. workshop-2-the-carcass. gravel-yard, 09:00, Clear, +25 ticks. Nelim (no duster: it warmed up) walks up to the dead Megaspider; Shogun, facing the carcass
#         (East), waits for her. Root size 3.5 centred (169, 143): carcass lower right and large, Nelim centre-left, long morning shadows. Decor (the hunt), place
#         kept as is: a DR_StickLantern (173, 146), a PlantPot (164, 142), a Plant_Daylily fully grown (172, 140), a Bow_Short on the grass (165, 146) (she just put it
#         down), a Stool (166, 141). Says: the hunt is over, the work begins. Moment: the kill is just behind her, the knife is next. Gesture: forced walk to (167, 144)
#         plus a paused advance of 25 ticks (played); Shogun stands facing the carcass. 4.5 (j weak: the carcass, not the missing bone).
#   3. workshop-3-the-butcher-table. barn, 11:00. Just after the cut: Nelim, rust shirt, at the TableButcher (194, 237), steps back from it facing South (toward the
#         camera); the carcass is gone (it was cut), the products (meat, fat, leather) lie in a row from (191, 240) on the floor in front of the table, the bone-free
#         pile is the biggest thing in frame; Shogun at (197, 239) watching, facing West. Root size 3 centred (194, 238), area emptied (190, 232) to (199, 243) so no
#         stray furniture shows. Decor (a working barn, the hay floor covered): a lit Brazier (197, 233), a Shelf (190, 233), DankPyon_Straw (192, 233), a PlantPot
#         (190, 241), a Plant_Daylily fully grown (196, 241), a Stool (196, 236), a DR_StickLantern lit (190, 236). Says: every cut comes away clean, no bone.
#         Moment: just after the cut, before she shelves the products. Gesture: `"Nelim" is forced to walk to` (194, 239) from (194, 236), paused advance of 20 ticks.
#         Estimate 4.5 (j weak until the missing bone reads).
#   4. workshop-4-the-products. barn east side, 14:00, Clear, +40 ticks. The east side of the barn emptied then dressed as a larder: a lit Brazier (203, 234), a
#         Shelf (204, 236), DankPyon_Straw (204, 241), a DR_StickLantern lit (201, 232), a Plant_Daylily fully grown (198, 241), a Stool (202, 242). Root size 3 centred
#         (201, 238), area emptied (195, 232) to (204, 242): in front, the products of the Megaspider (z 236); behind, those of a Muffalo with its bone (z 239); Shogun
#         side-on at (199, 238) facing East, head level with the Muffalo pile; Nelim, rust shirt, has just picked up a lump of fat from the spider pile and carries it to
#         the shelf. Says: one bone for the dog, none for the spider. Moment: just after the butchering, just before she shelves the fat. Gesture: `"Nelim" is forced
#         to haul 1 of the item "DankPyon_Fat"` to (204, 237) plus a paused advance of 40 ticks. Thumbnail: each pile is four cells wide at root 3, the bone a pale
#         shape against red meat, item labels hidden. 4.5 (j weak until the bone reads at 268 px).
#   5. workshop-5-the-hearth. fire-pit, 19:00. Nelim (rust shirt, ponytail) stands at the hearth, warming her hands; Shogun lies by the fire at (181, 112) next to
#         the Muffalo products (bone) and the Megaspider products (fat, no bone), both rows near him; no other animal (one subject: the dog's bone). Root size 3 centred
#         (180, 113), fire centre, Nelim at (180, 114) north of the hearth, Shogun foreground. Decor: DR_StickLantern lit (183, 113), the sanctuary PlantPot beside the hearth,
#         no plant step can sow a pot; the hall's furniture stays. Says: supper by the fire, the bone is the dog's and the spider gave none. Gesture: a still pose
#         (a hearth job is asked of NPT). 4.0 (e, j weak).
#
# Mods: the "gallery" map (wsl-deps.gallery.map): Sanctuary, bodies and faces, Medieval Overhaul (the fat and the bone contrast), Alpha Animals,
# Megafauna, Stick Lantern. Nothing staged ships with this mod. Colonists: Nelim only. Animals dressed: none.
# Steps (NPT answered 2026-10-26, nothing refused): forced walk + paused advance (played); forced haul, lying animal (played in 105f); the animal of the fixture
# "Shogun" stands at a cell facing a direction (played). Not played: the Megaspider spawned alive (adult animal of kind) is the same step as the played
# Arthropleura spawn, only the kind changes.
